{"unit_id":"LittleBeaverStudio__agnes-media#card-zh","repo":"LittleBeaverStudio/agnes-media","commit":"d7a3710d29c130e4daa79e8092242b8a7ae9429a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"agnes-media 是 DSH 的媒体生成插件，通过工具接口调用 Agnes AI 模型。它注册 generate_image 和 generate_video，支持文本生成图片、文本生成短视频，以及用最多五张参考图生成视频。图片工具可调整尺寸和数量，视频工具支持时长、画幅比例与随机种子。适合需要在 DSH 对话中创建图片或短视频的用户；使用前需配置 Agnes AI API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:178-185","index.js:289-299","index.js:228-257","index.js:391-429"]}
{"unit_id":"LittleBeaverStudio__agnes-media#card-en","repo":"LittleBeaverStudio/agnes-media","commit":"d7a3710d29c130e4daa79e8092242b8a7ae9429a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"agnes-media adds DSH tools for Agnes AI image and video generation. It supports text-to-image, text-to-video, and video guided by up to five reference images. Users can set image dimensions and count, or video duration, aspect ratio, and seed. An Agnes AI API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:178-185","index.js:289-299","index.js:228-257","index.js:391-429"]}
