{"unit_id":"LittleBeaverStudio__agnes-media#feature-1","repo":"LittleBeaverStudio/agnes-media","commit":"d7a3710d29c130e4daa79e8092242b8a7ae9429a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"agnes-media 的图片生成功能：将文字提示发送给 Agnes image 模型并返回图片 URL。通过 generate_image 工具触发，可设置尺寸并请求最多四张图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:181-204","index.js:238-257","index.js:275-285"]}
{"unit_id":"LittleBeaverStudio__agnes-media#feature-2","repo":"LittleBeaverStudio/agnes-media","commit":"d7a3710d29c130e4daa79e8092242b8a7ae9429a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"agnes-media 的短视频生成功能：根据文字提示提交异步视频任务，并轮询状态直至返回视频链接。通过 generate_video 触发，可设置 4–12 秒时长、画幅比例和随机种子。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:289-320","index.js:403-429","index.js:452-498"]}
{"unit_id":"LittleBeaverStudio__agnes-media#feature-3","repo":"LittleBeaverStudio/agnes-media","commit":"d7a3710d29c130e4daa79e8092242b8a7ae9429a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"agnes-media 的参考图视频功能：给 generate_video 提供一至五张图片 URL 或 data URI，即以参考模式生成视频；首张作为主要参考，其余补充风格或物件信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:334-343","index.js:391-415"]}
{"unit_id":"LittleBeaverStudio__agnes-media#caveat-1","repo":"LittleBeaverStudio/agnes-media","commit":"d7a3710d29c130e4daa79e8092242b8a7ae9429a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"agnes-media 会把提示词、可选参考图和 API Key 发往配置的 Agnes AI 服务以生成媒体内容；默认服务为 apihub.agnes-ai.cn。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:249-257","index.js:421-429","index.js:461-465"]}
{"unit_id":"LittleBeaverStudio__agnes-media#caveat-2","repo":"LittleBeaverStudio/agnes-media","commit":"d7a3710d29c130e4daa79e8092242b8a7ae9429a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"agnes-media 必须配置 Agnes API Key，可使用 AGNES_MEDIA_API_KEY、备用变量 AGNES_API_KEY 或 DSH credentials；没有凭证时工具会报错。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:71-86","index.js:228-235"]}
